{"seq":9,"slug":"data-platform-engineering","title":"数据平台工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据平台工程-简介\">数据平台工程 简介</h1><p>数据平台工程是连接原始数据与业务价值的基础设施核心学科。它关注如何构建可靠、高效、可扩展的数据系统，使组织能够在 PB 级数据规模下完成从采集、存储、处理到服务的全链路数据流转。</p>\n<p>与侧重分析建模的数据科学不同，数据平台工程聚焦于底层架构选型、系统可靠性、性能优化和运维治理。一个优秀的数据平台需要在实时性、成本、一致性和易用性之间取得精妙的平衡。</p>\n<p>本知识库从基础设施视角出发，系统覆盖数据平台的四大核心领域：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>数据平台架构</strong>，介绍现代数据栈的演进脉络、湖仓一体的融合趋势，以及数据网格带来的去中心化范式转变。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>采集与处理</strong>，深入批处理与流处理两大计算范式的引擎实现，探讨 ETL/ELT 编排在现代数据管道中的设计模式与最佳实践。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>存储与查询</strong>，剖析列式存储格式的设计哲学、查询引擎的优化策略，以及元数据目录在数据资产管理中的关键作用。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>治理与运维</strong>，涵盖数据质量工程的自动化保障、数据血缘与可观测性的落地方案，以及大规模数据平台的成本优化与弹性伸缩策略。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：具备分布式系统基础和 SQL 经验的工程师可直接从第一章开始顺序学习；已有 Hadoop/Spark 经验者可跳至第三章深入存储与查询优化；平台运维人员建议从第四章的治理与运维入手，再回溯架构设计。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-platform-architecture","title":"数据平台架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/data-platform-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modern-data-stack","title":"现代数据栈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/data-platform-architecture/modern-data-stack"},{"seq":2,"slug":"lakehouse-architecture","title":"湖仓一体架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/data-platform-architecture/lakehouse-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-mesh-and-federation","title":"数据网格与联邦","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/data-platform-architecture/data-mesh-and-federation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ingestion-and-processing","title":"采集与处理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/ingestion-and-processing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"batch-processing-engines","title":"批处理引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/ingestion-and-processing/batch-processing-engines"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stream-processing-architecture","title":"流处理架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/ingestion-and-processing/stream-processing-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"etl-elt-orchestration","title":"ETL/ELT 编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/ingestion-and-processing/etl-elt-orchestration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"storage-and-query","title":"存储与查询","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/storage-and-query","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"columnar-storage-formats","title":"列式存储格式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/storage-and-query/columnar-storage-formats"},{"seq":2,"slug":"query-engine-optimization","title":"查询引擎优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/storage-and-query/query-engine-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metadata-and-catalog","title":"元数据与数据目录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/storage-and-query/metadata-and-catalog"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"governance-and-operations","title":"治理与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-quality-engineering","title":"数据质量工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/data-quality-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-lineage-and-observability","title":"数据血缘与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/data-platform-engineering/governance-and-operations/data-lineage-and-observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-and-scaling","title":"成本优化与弹性伸缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/da